{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc | sed -n '730,810p'\"","aggregated_output":"   730\t   descriptor. It carries no authorization, no surface and no\n   731\t   anchors; the mirror answers those.\"\n   732\t  [d]\n   733\t  (and (stream/valid-descriptor? d)\n   734\t       (= :dao.stream/remote (:dao.stream/type d))\n   735\t       (contains? d :dao.stream/channel)))\n   736\t\n   737\t\n   738\t(defn attacher\n   739\t  \"The composition's :dao.stream/attach entry for :dao.stream/remote\n   740\t   descriptors; a dynamic dispatch table has this entry and no\n   741\t   :dao.stream/create one, because attaching through this transport\n   742\t   never creates. `opts` carries the composition data:\n   743\t   :dao.stream.remote/channels maps each channel descriptor this peer\n   744\t   reaches to its own end {:reader r :writer w} -- two ring buffers in\n   745\t   one process today, the ws, udp and pair channels of section 3\n   746\t   later; :dao.stream.remote/events is the optional event writer the\n   747\t   links emit on; :dao.stream.remote/resend-after is the links'\n   748\t   resend-after k, unbounded on an ordered reliable channel and small\n   749\t   on udp; :dao.stream.remote/budget is the budget stamped on every\n   750\t   next request. One link is kept per channel descriptor, shared by\n   751\t   every reflection through that channel. attach! answers ok at once\n   752\t   with a reflection handle and a local, opaque\n   753\t   :dao.stream/attachment -- the contract's deferred remote\n   754\t   confirmation -- and the link sends one descriptor probe for the\n   755\t   identity: its answer is the reflection's confirmation, not-found\n   756\t   marking the reflection gone, ok recording the source's descriptor\n   757\t   and declared surface.\"\n   758\t  [opts]\n   759\t  (let [channels (:dao.stream.remote/channels opts)\n   760\t        policy (select-keys opts [:dao.stream.remote/events\n   761\t                                  :dao.stream.remote/resend-after\n   762\t                                  :dao.stream.remote/budget])\n   763\t        links (atom {})]\n   764\t    (fn [descriptor]\n   765\t      (if-not (valid-remote-descriptor? descriptor)\n   766\t        (result :dao.stream/invalid-descriptor)\n   767\t        (let [cd (:dao.stream/channel descriptor)]\n   768\t          (if-not (contains? channels cd)\n   769\t            (result :dao.stream/not-found)\n   770\t            (do (swap! links\n   771\t                       (fn [m]\n   772\t                         (if (contains? m cd)\n   773\t                           m\n   774\t                           (assoc m cd\n   775\t                                  (new-link (get channels cd) policy)))))\n   776\t                (let [link (get @links cd)\n   777\t                      refl (atom {:link link\n   778\t                                  :descriptor descriptor\n   779\t                                  :identity (:dao.stream/identity\n   780\t                                              descriptor)\n   781\t                                  :surface nil\n   782\t                                  :source-descriptor nil\n   783\t                                  :gone? false\n   784\t                                  :closed? false\n   785\t                                  :ids #{}})]\n   786\t                  (send-request!\n   787\t                    link refl\n   788\t                    (wire-request link refl :dao.stream/descriptor []))\n   789\t                  {:dao.stream/outcome :dao.stream/ok\n   790\t                   :dao.stream/handle (ReflectionHandle. refl)\n   791\t                   :dao.stream/attachment (str (random-uuid))}))))))))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
